  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;Species&quot;</span>,</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">     recordDateTimeCol    <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;DateTimeOriginal&quot;</span>,</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">     species              <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">x</span>,     <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(136,136,136)\"># this gets modifies by lapply</span></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">     occasionLength       <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(21,20,181)\">7</span>,</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">     day1                 <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;station&quot;</span>,</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">     datesAsOccasionNames <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">FALSE</span>,</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">     includeEffort        <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">TRUE</span>,</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">     scaleEffort          <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">FALSE</span>,</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">     timeZone             <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;Asia/Kuala_Lumpur&quot;</span></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">   <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">)</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">}</span></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">)</span></span></span></span></div><div> to build the detection histories for then fitting a Community model, many many warnings are shown, along with the famous sentence:</div><div><br></div><div> &quot;Error in cleanSubsetSpecies(subset_species2 = subset_species, stationCol2 = stationCol,  :</div>  No more records left. The detection history would be empty.<br><div>In addition: There were 50 warnings (use warnings() to see them)&quot;</div><div><br></div><div>Question is: Why surveyReport is not catching these issues?</div><div><br></div><div>Stef</div><div><br></div><div><br></div></blockquote></div>"
